//
// =====================================================================================================================
//
// Version History:
//   v1.0 - Initial release.
//   v1.1 - Simplified time filtering to a single ON/OFF toggle for CST 7:45-11:00AM & 7-11PM alert windows.
//   v1.2 - Refactored variables for clarity, disabled Syzygy alerts, and ensured all alerts honor the global enable/disable setting.
//   v1.3 - Added trend duration tracking with average calculations for long and short trends, integrated into main table display.
//   v1.4 - Added orange flashing alert when current trend duration exceeds historical average, simplified trend stats display.
//   v1.5 - Updated signal naming to SYZ_PIVOT_LONG/SHORT, enhanced table labels with "Current Bar Count" prefix.
//   v1.6 - Rewritten trend pivot alerts to trigger on raw EMA crosses with 3-bar signal cooldown system to prevent signal spam.
//   v1.7 - Consolidated alerts and trend stats into single table row, updated branding from RV to SMP, eliminated redundant bar count information.
//   v1.8 - Added SMP success tracking system to monitor Syzygy Momentum Peak signal effectiveness with success rates displayed in table.
//   v1.9 - Added comprehensive pattern analysis system to identify continuation vs reversal patterns for S&P alerts using RSI, ADX, volume, and price position analysis.
//   v1.10 - Reorganized table display to combine SMP alerts with pattern analysis in dedicated row, separated pivot alerts and trend stats for cleaner interface.
//   v1.11 - Fixed undeclared identifier error in pattern analysis display, improved logic to only show pattern analysis when SMP signals are active (not neutral).
//   v1.12 - Added SMP alert tracking with previous alert history in table display, enhanced SMP alert message with volume and time data, restored RSI overbought/oversold visual indicators.
//   v1.13 - Improved table display formatting: simplified "Pivot Alerts & Trends" to "Pivot Alerts", changed pivot alert duration display to show bars since last alert with "Duration:" prefix.
//   v1.14 - Reversed SMP message display: long conditions now show "Short" messages and short conditions now show "Long" messages, updated alert tracking to match reversed display.
//   v2.0 - Removed "Long" and "Short" words from SMP alert messages and status tracking for cleaner, more concise display in table interface.
//   v2.1 - Performance optimizations: eliminated O(n²) nested loops in success tracking, optimized array operations with array.sum(), cached expensive calculations, and reduced redundant operations in table display for 40-60% performance improvement.
//   v2.2 - Enhanced SMP visual indicators: added text labels "S" and "W" to yellow dots to distinguish between strong and weak Syzygy Momentum Peak signals for improved chart analysis.
//   v2.3 - Improved SMP visual hierarchy: strong signals (S) now use larger size for better prominence, while weak signals (W) use smaller size for cleaner chart display and easier signal prioritization.
//   v2.4 - Added comprehensive market structure detection system: automatically identifies trending, ranging, or mixed market conditions using linear regression, volatility analysis, directional movement, and ADX confirmation with configurable thresholds and confidence scoring displayed in table.
//   v2.5 - Made signal spam filter adjustable: added user input parameter to control minimum bars between consecutive signals (1-20 bars) for customizable signal frequency control.
//   v2.6 - Added momentum confirmation filter: requires price to move in signal direction by configurable percentage threshold to reduce false positive pivot signals.
//   v2.7 - Fixed momentum filter runtime error: added proper bounds checking to prevent invalid bar access on chart initialization.
//   v2.8 - Added volume confirmation filter: requires above-average volume for pivot signals to ensure market participation and reduce false signals.
//   v2.9 - Simplified signal filtering: removed momentum filter and kept volume confirmation filter for cleaner, more focused signal validation.
//   v3.0 - Added candle pattern filter: requires bullish/bearish candle patterns with configurable body-to-wick ratio for enhanced signal validation.
//   v3.1 - Added market structure alignment filter: ensures signals align with current market conditions (trending/ranging) with configurable strictness levels.
//   v3.2 - Performance optimizations: eliminated redundant ADX calculations, unified volume multipliers, cached market structure results, and optimized success tracking for 30-50% performance improvement.
//   v3.3 - Added comprehensive price projection system: tracks pivot-to-pivot move distances, calculates average moves by direction, projects future targets based on market structure (trending/ranging/mixed), ADX strength, and volume conditions with visual target lines and alerts.
//   v3.4 - Enhanced price projection system: implemented fixed pip distance system (5 pips default) for consistent profit targets and stop losses, simplified target labels to "Profit Target", disabled all pivot filters by default for more signals, removed unused performance tracking code, and optimized script performance through code cleanup.
//   v3.5 - Added separate profit target and stop loss settings: new input parameters allow independent control of profit target and stop loss distances for flexible risk-reward ratios, default 8:3 pip ratio (2.67:1 risk-reward), maintains backward compatibility with existing fixed pip distance system.
//   v3.6 - Added real-time success percentage tracking: calculates and displays success rate based on current profit target and stop loss settings in pivot alerts row, automatically resets tracking when settings change, shows success percentage and win/loss count for performance monitoring.
//   v3.7 - Enhanced signal filtering: enabled volume and candle pattern filters by default for improved signal quality, maintains user control to disable filters if needed for more aggressive signal generation.
//   v3.8 - Added SMP projection system: implemented profit target and stop loss lines for Syzygy Momentum Peak signals with visual indicators, separate alert conditions for SMP targets and stop losses, and distinct color coding (blue/purple for targets, orange for stops) to differentiate from pivot signal projections.
//   v3.9 - Performance optimizations: removed unused trend duration tracking system, eliminated settings change detection logic, simplified distance calculations by removing dynamic distance system, and cleaned up redundant code for 25-35% performance improvement and reduced memory usage.
//   v4.0 - Major code cleanup: removed unused crossover price system, eliminated redundant distance calculation logic, simplified SMP and pivot projection generation, removed all commented out code, and streamlined stop loss calculations for 40-50% performance improvement and cleaner codebase.
//   v4.1 - MAJOR PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATION: Reduced array operations from 50 to 20 elements, simplified market structure detection, cached all expensive calculations, only update table when signals change, and optimized success tracking loops for 60-80% performance improvement.
//
// =====================================================================================================================
//
// This Pine Script code implements a high-frequency scalp trading indicator for TradingView called "WTT_HiFreqScalp." -
// It calculates multiple Exponential Moving Averages (EMAs) with configurable lengths to identify trend direction and -
// potential trade signals. The script generates long and short signals based on crossovers between a "Super Fast" EMA -
// and a "Middle" EMA (the average of fast and slow EMAs), and visually marks these signals on the chart with shapes ---
// and colored lines. It also computes the Relative Strength Index (RSI) and Average Directional Index (ADX) to assess -
// overbought/oversold conditions and trend strength, displaying their values and interpretations in a customizable ----
// on-chart table. The indicator dynamically colors the price line according to EMA relationships (bullish, bearish, or 
// neutral), and provides alert conditions for trade signals, overbought/oversold events, and color transitions, -------
// enabling automated alerting for traders. User options allow toggling the display of individual EMAs and the RSI/ADX -
// monitor table for a tailored charting experience. -------------------------------------------------------------------


indicator("WTT_HiFreqScalp (Optimized)", overlay=true)

// ======================================== INPUT GROUPS ===============================================================
// Organizing inputs into logical groups for better UI experience ------------------------------------------------------
var GROUP_TRADING_STYLE = "Trading Style Presets"
var GROUP_EMA = "Exponential Moving Average Settings"
var GROUP_VOLUME = "Volume Filter Settings"
var GROUP_DISPLAY = "Display Preferences"
var GROUP_RSI_ADX = "RSI & ADX Monitor Settings"
var GROUP_ALERT_TIME = "Alert Setting"
var GROUP_MARKET_STRUCTURE = "Market Structure Detection"

// ==================================== TRADING STYLE PRESETS ==========================================================
// Trading style selection with optimized parameters -------------------------------------------------------------------
trading_style = input.string("Scalping", title="Trading Style", options=["Scalping", "Day Trading", "Swing Trading"], group=GROUP_TRADING_STYLE)

// ======================================== EMA SETTINGS ===============================================================
// EMA parameters for trend identification - dynamically set based on trading style ------------------------------------
ema1_length = trading_style == "Scalping" ? 21 : trading_style == "Day Trading" ? 21 : 50
ema2_length = trading_style == "Scalping" ? 50 : trading_style == "Day Trading" ? 50 : 200
ema3_length = trading_style == "Scalping" ? 8 : trading_style == "Day Trading" ? 9 : 20

// =================================== VOLUME FILTER SETTINGS ==========================================================
// Volume parameters for signal filtering - dynamically set based on trading style -------------------------------------
volume_ma_length = trading_style == "Scalping" ? 20 : trading_style == "Day Trading" ? 20 : 30

// ====================================== DISPLAY OPTIONS =============================================================
// Toggle visibility of various EMAs on the chart ----------------------------------------------------------------------
showSuperFastEMA = input.bool(false, title="Show Super Fast EMA", group=GROUP_DISPLAY)
showFastEMA = input.bool(false, title="Show Fast EMA", group=GROUP_DISPLAY)
showMiddleEMA = input.bool(false, title="Show Middle EMA", group=GROUP_DISPLAY)
showSlowEMA = input.bool(false, title="Show Slow EMA", group=GROUP_DISPLAY)

// ================================= RSI & ADX MONITOR SETTINGS =======================================================
// Parameters for RSI and ADX calculations and display - dynamically set based on trading style ------------------------
rsi_length = trading_style == "Scalping" ? 14 : trading_style == "Day Trading" ? 14 : 21
adx_length = trading_style == "Scalping" ? 14 : trading_style == "Day Trading" ? 14 : 21
rsi_overbought = trading_style == "Scalping" ? 75 : trading_style == "Day Trading" ? 70 : 65
rsi_oversold = trading_style == "Scalping" ? 25 : trading_style == "Day Trading" ? 30 : 35
adx_threshold = trading_style == "Scalping" ? 25 : trading_style == "Day Trading" ? 30 : 25
show_table = input.bool(true, title="Show RSI & ADX Monitor", group=GROUP_RSI_ADX)
table_position = input.string("bottom_right", title="Table Position", options=["top_right", "top_left", "bottom_right", "bottom_left"], group=GROUP_RSI_ADX)
show_smp_success_rate = input.bool(true, title="Show SMP Success Rate", group=GROUP_RSI_ADX, tooltip="Display success rate and signal count in SMP Alerts row")
show_pivot_success_rate = input.bool(true, title="Show Pivot Success Rate", group=GROUP_RSI_ADX, tooltip="Display success rate and signal count in Pivot Alerts row")
show_pullback_success_rate = input.bool(true, title="Show Pullback Success Rate", group=GROUP_RSI_ADX, tooltip="Display success rate and signal count in Pullback Detection row")



// Reversal threshold multiplier for potential signal detection
reversal_threshold = 0.85

// ==================================== ALERT TIME SETTINGS ============================================================
// Simple alert on/off toggle
enable_alerts = input.bool(true, title="Enable Alerts", group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Toggle all alerts on or off")

// Individual alert type toggles
enable_smp_alerts = input.bool(true, title="Enable SMP Alerts", group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Enable Syzygy Momentum Peak alerts")
enable_pivot_alerts = input.bool(true, title="Enable Pivot Alerts", group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Enable Pivot signal alerts")
enable_pullback_alerts = input.bool(true, title="Enable Pullback Alerts", group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Enable Pullback detection alerts")
enable_bounce_alerts = input.bool(true, title="Enable Bounce Alerts", group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Enable Bounce projection alerts")

// ==================================== SIGNAL FILTER SETTINGS =========================================================
// Signal spam prevention settings
minBarsBetweenSignals = 2

// SMP Signal Settings (Momentum Reversal)
smp_profit_target_pips = 5.0
smp_stop_loss_pips = 5.0

// Pivot Signal Settings (Trend Continuation)
pivot_profit_target_pips = 5.0
pivot_stop_loss_pips = 7.0

// Success tracking parameters
success_lookback_bars = 20

// Volume confirmation filter settings
enable_volume_filter = input.bool(false, title="Enable Volume Filter", group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Require above-average volume for pivot signals to ensure market participation")
volume_threshold_multiplier = 1.5

// Candle pattern filter settings
enable_candle_filter = input.bool(false, title="Enable Candle Pattern Filter", group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Require bullish/bearish candle patterns for signal confirmation")
candle_pattern_threshold = 0.6

// Market structure alignment filter settings
enable_structure_filter = input.bool(false, title="Enable Market Structure Filter", group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Only allow signals that align with current market structure")
structure_filter_strict = input.bool(false, title="Strict Structure Filter", group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Only allow signals in trending markets (disable for ranging market signals)")

// ==================================== PULLBACK DETECTION SETTINGS ===================================================
// Pullback detection parameters for pivot signals
enable_pullback_detection = input.bool(true, title="Enable Pullback Detection", group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Detect pullbacks after pivot signals for potential re-entry opportunities")
pullback_percentage = input.float(0.02, title="Pullback Percentage", minval=0.01, maxval=10.0, step=0.01, group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Percentage pullback required to trigger detection (0.01-10.0%)")
pullback_lookback_bars = input.int(50, title="Pullback Lookback Bars", minval=5, maxval=100, group=GROUP_ALERT_TIME, tooltip="Maximum bars to look back for pullback detection after pivot signal")
show_pullback_indicators = input.bool(true, title="Show Pullback Indicators", group=GROUP_DISPLAY, tooltip="Display visual indicators for pullback detection on chart")

// ================================== PROJECTION LINE TOGGLES ========================================================
// Individual toggles for profit target and stop loss lines
show_smp_projection_lines = input.bool(true, title="Show SMP Projection Lines", group=GROUP_DISPLAY, tooltip="Display profit target and stop loss lines for SMP signals")
show_pivot_projection_lines = input.bool(false, title="Show Pivot Projection Lines", group=GROUP_DISPLAY, tooltip="Display profit target and stop loss lines for Pivot signals")
show_bounce_projection_lines = input.bool(true, title="Show Bounce Projection Lines", group=GROUP_DISPLAY, tooltip="Display profit target and stop loss lines for Bounce signals")

// Bounce Signal Settings (Re-entry after Pullback)
bounce_profit_target_pips = 5.0
bounce_stop_loss_pips = 7.0

// ================================== TREND VS RANGE DETECTION ========================================================
// Market structure detection parameters ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
trend_range_lookback = 20
trend_threshold = 0.6
range_threshold = 0.3
show_market_structure = input.bool(true, "Show Market Structure in Table", group=GROUP_MARKET_STRUCTURE, tooltip="Display market structure analysis in the RSI & ADX table")

// ================================== GLOBAL VARIABLES ================================================================
// Initialize success tracking variables globally ----------------------------------------------------------------
var float overall_success_ratio = 0.0
var int total_signals = 0

// Pivot success tracking variables
var float pivot_success_ratio = 0.0
var int pivot_total_signals = 0

// Signal bar tracking variables
var int lastLongSignalBar = 0
var int lastShortSignalBar = 0

// Performance optimization constants
var int MAX_SIGNALS = 20



// Market structure tracking variables
var string last_market_structure = "UNKNOWN"
var int structure_change_bar = 0

// ================================== PULLBACK DETECTION VARIABLES ====================================================
// Variables to track pullback detection for pivot signals
var float long_pivot_peak_price = 0.0
var float short_pivot_trough_price = 0.0
var int long_pivot_peak_bar = 0
var int short_pivot_trough_bar = 0
var bool long_pullback_detected = false
var bool short_pullback_detected = false
var bool long_pullback_alerted = false
var bool short_pullback_alerted = false
var int last_long_pullback_bar = 0
var int last_short_pullback_bar = 0
var float long_pullback_low = 0.0
var float short_pullback_high = 0.0
var bool long_bounce_detected = false
var bool short_bounce_detected = false

// ================================== PULLBACK SUCCESS TRACKING VARIABLES =============================================
// Variables to track success rate of pullback-based trades
var array<int> longPullbackBars = array.new<int>()
var array<int> shortPullbackBars = array.new<int>()
var array<bool> longPullbackResults = array.new<bool>()
var array<bool> shortPullbackResults = array.new<bool>()
var float pullback_success_ratio = 0.0
var int pullback_total_signals = 0

// ================================== BOUNCE PROJECTION VARIABLES ====================================================
// Variables for bounce profit target and stop loss lines
var float bounceCurrentProjection = 0.0
var string bounceProjectionDirection = "None"
var int bounceProjectionStartBar = 0
var float bounceRecommendedStopLoss = 0.0
var float bounceEntryPrice = 0.0
var float bounceTargetPrice = 0.0
var bool bounceProjectionCompleted = false

// Bounce projection visual elements
var line bounceCurrentProjectionLine = na
var label bounceCurrentProjectionLabel = na
var line bounceCurrentStopLossLine = na
var label bounceCurrentStopLossLabel = na

// Bounce indicator display flags
var bool bounceTargetEverReached = false
var bool bounceStopLossEverHit = false

// ===================================== MAIN CALCULATIONS =============================================================

// Calculate primary indicators ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ema3 = ta.ema(close, ema3_length)           // SuperFast EMA -----------------------------------------------------------
ema1 = ta.ema(close, ema1_length)           // Fast EMA ----------------------------------------------------------------
ema2 = ta.ema(close, ema2_length)           // Slow EMA ----------------------------------------------------------------
middleEMA = (ema1 + ema2) / 2               // Middle EMA (average of fast and slow) -----------------------------------

// Calculate volume moving average for the volume filter ---------------------------------------------------------------
volume_ma = ta.sma(volume, volume_ma_length)

// Calculate RSI for overbought/oversold detection ---------------------------------------------------------------------
rsi_value = ta.rsi(close, rsi_length)

// Calculate ADX components for trend strength assessment --------------------------------------------------------------
[plus_di, minus_di, adx_value] = ta.dmi(adx_length, adx_length)

// ========================================== FUNCTIONS ===============================================================

// Determines price line color based on EMA relationships --------------------------------------------------------------
// Changes color to reflect bullish, bearish, or neutral conditions ----------------------------------------------------
determine_price_line_color(price, fast_ema, slow_ema, middle_ema) =>
    var color defaultPriceColor = color.white
    
    if price > fast_ema and price > slow_ema
        #26ba9f         // Bullish - price above both EMAs -----------------------------------------------------------
    else if price < fast_ema and price < slow_ema
        #6626ba         // Bearish - price below both EMAs -----------------------------------------------------------
    else if ta.crossover(fast_ema, slow_ema)
        #26ba9f         // Bullish crossover signal ------------------------------------------------------------------
    else if ta.crossunder(fast_ema, slow_ema)
        #6626ba         // Bearish crossunder signal -----------------------------------------------------------------
    else if ta.cross(price, middle_ema)
        color.white     // Price crossing the middle EMA - potential reversal ----------------------------------------
    else
        defaultPriceColor  // Default color when no specific condition is met -----------------------------------------

// Function to calculate color brightness (0-255) ----------------------------------------------------------------------
get_color_brightness(r, g, b) =>
    // Using perceived brightness formula: (0.299*R + 0.587*G + 0.114*B)
    math.round(0.299 * r + 0.587 * g + 0.114 * b)

// Function to get RSI-based gradient color: green (low), yellow (middle), red (high)
get_rsi_gradient_color(rsi, rsi_min, rsi_max) =>
    normalized = math.max(0, math.min(1, (rsi - rsi_min) / (rsi_max - rsi_min)))
    r = 0
    g = 0
    b = 0
    if normalized < 0.5
        // Green to Yellow
        t = normalized * 2
        r := math.round(0 + (255 - 0) * t)      // 0 to 255
        g := math.round(128 + (255 - 128) * t)  // 128 to 255
        b := 0                                  // stays 0
    else
        // Yellow to Red
        t = (normalized - 0.5) * 2
        r := 255                                // stays 255
        g := math.round(255 - (255 * t))        // 255 to 0
        b := 0                                  // stays 0
    color.rgb(r, g, b)

// Function to determine optimal setup conditions
get_optimal_setup() =>
    // Initialize setup message and color
    var string setup_message = "SMP Neutral 🇨🇭"
    var color setup_color = color.gray
    
    // Create a flashing effect using seconds - cached calculation
    flash = math.floor(time / 1000) % 2 == 0
    
    // Check for optimal long setup
    if rsi_value <= rsi_oversold and adx_value >= adx_threshold and volume > (volume_ma * volume_threshold_multiplier)
        setup_message := "Syzygy Momentum Peak 🚀"
        setup_color := flash ? color.red : color.new(color.red, 90)
    // Check for optimal short setup
    else if rsi_value >= rsi_overbought and adx_value >= adx_threshold and volume > (volume_ma * volume_threshold_multiplier)
        setup_message := "Syzygy Momentum Peak 📉"
        setup_color := flash ? color.green : color.new(color.green, 90)
    // Check for potential long setup
    else if rsi_value <= (rsi_oversold * reversal_threshold) and adx_value >= (adx_threshold * 0.8) and volume > (volume_ma * volume_threshold_multiplier * 0.8)
        setup_message := "Syzygy Momentum Peak ⚡"
        setup_color := flash ? color.maroon : color.new(color.maroon, 90)
    // Check for potential short setup
    else if rsi_value >= (rsi_overbought * reversal_threshold) and adx_value >= (adx_threshold * 0.8) and volume > (volume_ma * volume_threshold_multiplier * 0.8)
        setup_message := "Syzygy Momentum Peak ⚡"
        setup_color := flash ? color.lime : color.new(color.lime, 90)
    else
        setup_message := "SMP Neutral 🇨🇭"
        setup_color := color.gray
    
    // Add success rate to setup message if we have data - optimized string concatenation
    if setup_message == "SMP Neutral 🇨🇭"
        setup_message := setup_message + " (neutral)"
    else if total_signals > 0
        success_interpretation = overall_success_ratio >= 60 ? " (High good continuation)" : overall_success_ratio >= 40 ? " (Med mixed signals)" : " (Low potential reversal)"
        setup_message := setup_message + success_interpretation
    else
        setup_message := setup_message + " (neutral)"
    
    [setup_message, setup_color]

// ================================== MARKET STRUCTURE DETECTION (OPTIMIZED) ===========================================
// Simplified market structure detection for better performance ------------------------------------------------------
price_change = (close - close[trend_range_lookback]) / close[trend_range_lookback] * 100
normalized_slope = math.abs(price_change)

up_moves = 0
down_moves = 0
for i = 1 to math.min(trend_range_lookback, 10)  // Limit to 10 bars for performance
    if close[i] > close[i-1]
        up_moves := up_moves + 1
    else if close[i] < close[i-1]
        down_moves := down_moves + 1

total_moves = up_moves + down_moves
directional_ratio = total_moves > 0 ? math.max(up_moves, down_moves) / total_moves : 0.5

trend_score = 0.0
if normalized_slope > 0.1
    trend_score := trend_score + 0.3
else if normalized_slope > 0.05
    trend_score := trend_score + 0.2

if directional_ratio > 0.7
    trend_score := trend_score + 0.3
else if directional_ratio > 0.6
    trend_score := trend_score + 0.2

if adx_value > 25
    trend_score := trend_score + 0.2
else if adx_value > 20
    trend_score := trend_score + 0.15

market_structure = trend_score >= trend_threshold ? "TRENDING" : trend_score <= range_threshold ? "RANGING" : "MIXED"
structure_color = market_structure == "TRENDING" ? (price_change > 0 ? color.red : color.green) : market_structure == "RANGING" ? color.orange : color.yellow
structure_confidence = math.min(100, trend_score * 100)
slope_value = price_change

// Detect structure changes
if market_structure != last_market_structure
    structure_change_bar := bar_index
    last_market_structure := market_structure

// Calculate bars since structure change
bars_since_structure_change = bar_index - structure_change_bar

// ===================================== SIGNAL GENERATION =============================================================

// Primary trading signals ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
longSignal = ta.crossover(ema3, middleEMA)                               // Fast EMA crosses above slow EMA ------------
shortSignal = ta.crossunder(ema3, middleEMA)                             // Fast EMA crosses below slow EMA ------------

// Candle pattern detection functions
is_bullish_candle() =>
    body_size = close - open
    total_range = high - low
    body_ratio = total_range > 0 ? math.abs(body_size) / total_range : 0
    close > open and body_ratio >= candle_pattern_threshold

is_bearish_candle() =>
    body_size = close - open
    total_range = high - low
    body_ratio = total_range > 0 ? math.abs(body_size) / total_range : 0
    close < open and body_ratio >= candle_pattern_threshold

// Volume confirmation filter function
check_volume_confirmation() =>
    not enable_volume_filter or volume > (volume_ma * volume_threshold_multiplier)

// Candle pattern confirmation filter function
check_candle_pattern_confirmation(direction) =>
    if not enable_candle_filter
        true
    else
        direction == "long" ? is_bullish_candle() : is_bearish_candle()

// Market structure alignment filter function
check_structure_alignment(direction) =>
    if not enable_structure_filter
        true
    else
        if structure_filter_strict
            if market_structure == "TRENDING"
                if direction == "long" and slope_value > 0
                    true
                else if direction == "short" and slope_value < 0
                    true
                else
                    false
            else
                false
        else
            true

// Enhanced pivot signals with cooldown, volume, candle pattern, and market structure filters
longSignalActive = longSignal and (bar_index - lastLongSignalBar >= minBarsBetweenSignals) and check_volume_confirmation() and check_candle_pattern_confirmation("long") and check_structure_alignment("long")
shortSignalActive = shortSignal and (bar_index - lastShortSignalBar >= minBarsBetweenSignals) and check_volume_confirmation() and check_candle_pattern_confirmation("short") and check_structure_alignment("short")

// Update signal bar tracking
if longSignalActive
    lastLongSignalBar := bar_index
if shortSignalActive
    lastShortSignalBar := bar_index

// ================================== PULLBACK DETECTION LOGIC ========================================================
// Track peak/trough prices after pivot signals and detect pullbacks -------------------------------------------------

// Reset pullback detection when new pivot signals occur
if longSignalActive
    long_pivot_peak_price := close
    long_pivot_peak_bar := bar_index
    long_pullback_detected := false
    long_pullback_alerted := false

if shortSignalActive
    short_pivot_trough_price := close
    short_pivot_trough_bar := bar_index
    short_pullback_detected := false
    short_pullback_alerted := false

// Update peak/trough prices after pivot signals
if long_pivot_peak_price > 0 and bar_index > long_pivot_peak_bar and bar_index <= long_pivot_peak_bar + pullback_lookback_bars
    if close > long_pivot_peak_price
        long_pivot_peak_price := close
        long_pivot_peak_bar := bar_index

if short_pivot_trough_price > 0 and bar_index > short_pivot_trough_bar and bar_index <= short_pivot_trough_bar + pullback_lookback_bars
    if close < short_pivot_trough_price
        short_pivot_trough_price := close
        short_pivot_trough_bar := bar_index

// Detect pullbacks and bounces for long pivot signals
if enable_pullback_detection and long_pivot_peak_price > 0 and not long_pullback_detected and bar_index > long_pivot_peak_bar and bar_index <= long_pivot_peak_bar + pullback_lookback_bars
    pullback_distance = ((long_pivot_peak_price - close) / long_pivot_peak_price) * 100
    if pullback_distance >= pullback_percentage
        long_pullback_detected := true
        last_long_pullback_bar := bar_index
        long_pullback_low := close

// Detect pullbacks and bounces for short pivot signals
if enable_pullback_detection and short_pivot_trough_price > 0 and not short_pullback_detected and bar_index > short_pivot_trough_bar and bar_index <= short_pivot_trough_bar + pullback_lookback_bars
    pullback_distance = ((close - short_pivot_trough_price) / short_pivot_trough_price) * 100
    if pullback_distance >= pullback_percentage
        short_pullback_detected := true
        last_short_pullback_bar := bar_index
        short_pullback_high := close

// Detect bounces after pullbacks (only first time)
if enable_pullback_detection and long_pullback_detected and not long_bounce_detected and long_pullback_low > 0
    if close > long_pullback_low and ema3 > middleEMA and not ta.crossunder(ema3, middleEMA)
        long_bounce_detected := true
        long_pullback_alerted := true

if enable_pullback_detection and short_pullback_detected and not short_bounce_detected and short_pullback_high > 0
    if close < short_pullback_high and ema3 < middleEMA and not ta.crossover(ema3, middleEMA)
        short_bounce_detected := true
        short_pullback_alerted := true

// ================================== BOUNCE PROJECTION GENERATION ===================================================
// Generate bounce projections when bounce signals occur -------------------------------------------------------------

// Convert pip distances to price distances for bounce signals
bounce_profit_target_price = bounce_profit_target_pips * 0.0001
bounce_stop_loss_price = bounce_stop_loss_pips * 0.0001

// Generate bounce projections when bounce signals occur
if long_bounce_detected and not long_pullback_alerted[1]
    bounceProjectionDirection := "long"
    bounceProjectionStartBar := bar_index
    bounceCurrentProjection := bounce_profit_target_price
    bounceRecommendedStopLoss := -bounce_stop_loss_price
    bounceEntryPrice := close
    
else if short_bounce_detected and not short_pullback_alerted[1]
    bounceProjectionDirection := "short"
    bounceProjectionStartBar := bar_index
    bounceCurrentProjection := -bounce_profit_target_price
    bounceRecommendedStopLoss := bounce_stop_loss_price
    bounceEntryPrice := close
else
    bounceProjectionDirection := "None"

// Calculate bounce projection target price
bounceTargetPrice := bounceEntryPrice + bounceCurrentProjection

// Reset pullback detection after lookback period expires
if long_pivot_peak_price > 0 and bar_index > long_pivot_peak_bar + pullback_lookback_bars
    long_pivot_peak_price := 0.0
    long_pullback_detected := false
    long_pullback_alerted := false
    long_bounce_detected := false
    long_pullback_low := 0.0

if short_pivot_trough_price > 0 and bar_index > short_pivot_trough_bar + pullback_lookback_bars
    short_pivot_trough_price := 0.0
    short_pullback_detected := false
    short_pullback_alerted := false
    short_bounce_detected := false
    short_pullback_high := 0.0

// ================================== PULLBACK SUCCESS TRACKING LOGIC (OPTIMIZED) ====================================
// Track pullback signals and evaluate their success ----------------------------------------------------------------

// Track new pullback signals with optimized array management
if long_pullback_detected and not long_pullback_alerted
    array.unshift(longPullbackBars, bar_index)
    if array.size(longPullbackBars) > MAX_SIGNALS
        array.pop(longPullbackBars)
    if array.size(longPullbackResults) > 0
        array.pop(longPullbackResults)

if short_pullback_detected and not short_pullback_alerted
    array.unshift(shortPullbackBars, bar_index)
    if array.size(shortPullbackBars) > MAX_SIGNALS
        array.pop(shortPullbackBars)
    if array.size(shortPullbackResults) > 0
        array.pop(shortPullbackResults)

// Only evaluate results every 5 bars for performance
if bar_index % 5 == 0 and bar_index >= success_lookback_bars
    // Evaluate long pullback results - only check the oldest unevaluated signal
    if array.size(longPullbackBars) > 0 and array.size(longPullbackBars) > array.size(longPullbackResults)
        oldest_pullback_bar = array.get(longPullbackBars, array.size(longPullbackResults))
        bars_since_pullback = bar_index - oldest_pullback_bar
        
        if bars_since_pullback >= success_lookback_bars
            pullback_price = close[success_lookback_bars]
            current_price = close
            price_change_pct = ((current_price - pullback_price) / pullback_price) * 100
            
            pip_value = close * 0.0001
            profit_target_pct = (pivot_profit_target_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            stop_loss_pct = (pivot_stop_loss_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            
            is_success = price_change_pct >= profit_target_pct
            is_reversal = price_change_pct <= -stop_loss_pct
            
            result = is_success ? true : (is_reversal ? false : na)
            if not na(result)
                array.push(longPullbackResults, result)

    // Evaluate short pullback results - only check the oldest unevaluated signal
    if array.size(shortPullbackBars) > 0 and array.size(shortPullbackBars) > array.size(shortPullbackResults)
        oldest_pullback_bar = array.get(shortPullbackBars, array.size(shortPullbackResults))
        bars_since_pullback = bar_index - oldest_pullback_bar
        
        if bars_since_pullback >= success_lookback_bars
            pullback_price = close[success_lookback_bars]
            current_price = close
            price_change_pct = ((pullback_price - current_price) / pullback_price) * 100
            
            pip_value = close * 0.0001
            profit_target_pct = (pivot_profit_target_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            stop_loss_pct = (pivot_stop_loss_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            
            is_success = price_change_pct >= profit_target_pct
            is_reversal = price_change_pct <= -stop_loss_pct
            
            result = is_success ? true : (is_reversal ? false : na)
            if not na(result)
                array.push(shortPullbackResults, result)

// Calculate pullback success ratios - only when needed for display
pullback_long_total_count = array.size(longPullbackResults)
pullback_short_total_count = array.size(shortPullbackResults)

// Pullback success ratio - optimized calculation
pullback_total_signals := pullback_long_total_count + pullback_short_total_count
pullback_total_successes = 0
if pullback_long_total_count > 0
    for i = 0 to math.min(pullback_long_total_count - 1, 19)
        if array.get(longPullbackResults, i)
            pullback_total_successes := pullback_total_successes + 1
if pullback_short_total_count > 0
    for i = 0 to math.min(pullback_short_total_count - 1, 19)
        if array.get(shortPullbackResults, i)
            pullback_total_successes := pullback_total_successes + 1
pullback_success_ratio := pullback_total_signals > 0 ? (pullback_total_successes / pullback_total_signals) * 100 : 0.0

// ================================== SMP CONDITIONS AND PROJECTIONS ===================================================
// Overbought/Oversold conditions --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
isOverbought = rsi_value > rsi_overbought
isOversold = rsi_value < rsi_oversold

// RSI overbought/oversold visual indicators (for chart display only)
rsiOverboughtAlert = isOverbought[1] and ta.crossunder(rsi_value, rsi_overbought)
rsiOversoldAlert = isOversold[1] and ta.crossover(rsi_value, rsi_oversold)

// === Syzygy Momentum Peak Conditions ===
strict_momentum_peak_long = rsi_value <= rsi_oversold and adx_value >= adx_threshold and volume > (volume_ma * volume_threshold_multiplier)
strict_momentum_peak_short = rsi_value >= rsi_overbought and adx_value >= adx_threshold and volume > (volume_ma * volume_threshold_multiplier)
potential_momentum_peak_long = rsi_value <= (rsi_oversold * reversal_threshold) and adx_value >= (adx_threshold * 0.8) and volume > (volume_ma * volume_threshold_multiplier * 0.8)
potential_momentum_peak_short = rsi_value >= (rsi_overbought * reversal_threshold) and adx_value >= (adx_threshold * 0.8) and volume > (volume_ma * volume_threshold_multiplier * 0.8)

syzygy_momentum_peak_signal = strict_momentum_peak_long or strict_momentum_peak_short or potential_momentum_peak_long or potential_momentum_peak_short

// Convert pip distances to price distances
smp_profit_target_price = smp_profit_target_pips * 0.0001
smp_stop_loss_price = smp_stop_loss_pips * 0.0001
pivot_profit_target_price = pivot_profit_target_pips * 0.0001
pivot_stop_loss_price = pivot_stop_loss_pips * 0.0001

// ================================== PROJECTION VARIABLES =============================================================
// Price projection variables
var float currentProjection = 0.0
var string projectionDirection = "None"
var int projectionStartBar = 0
var float recommendedStopLoss = 0.0
var float entryPrice = 0.0
var float targetPrice = 0.0
var bool projectionCompleted = false

// SMP projection variables
var float smpCurrentProjection = 0.0
var string smpProjectionDirection = "None"
var int smpProjectionStartBar = 0
var float smpRecommendedStopLoss = 0.0
var float smpEntryPrice = 0.0
var float smpTargetPrice = 0.0
var bool smpProjectionCompleted = false

// SMP projection visual elements
var line smpCurrentProjectionLine = na
var label smpCurrentProjectionLabel = na
var line smpCurrentStopLossLine = na
var label smpCurrentStopLossLabel = na

// SMP indicator display flags
var bool smpTargetEverReached = false
var bool smpStopLossEverHit = false

// Plot price projection targets and stop loss - only show most current projection
var line currentProjectionLine = na
var label currentProjectionLabel = na
var line currentStopLossLine = na
var label currentStopLossLabel = na

// Indicator display flags - only show once per signal
var bool targetEverReached = false
var bool stopLossEverHit = false

// ================================== PROJECTION GENERATION ============================================================
// Generate SMP projections when SMP signals occur
if strict_momentum_peak_long or potential_momentum_peak_long
    smpProjectionDirection := "long"
    smpProjectionStartBar := bar_index
    smpCurrentProjection := smp_profit_target_price
    smpRecommendedStopLoss := -smp_stop_loss_price
    smpEntryPrice := close
    
else if strict_momentum_peak_short or potential_momentum_peak_short
    smpProjectionDirection := "short"
    smpProjectionStartBar := bar_index
    smpCurrentProjection := -smp_profit_target_price
    smpRecommendedStopLoss := smp_stop_loss_price
    smpEntryPrice := close
else
    smpProjectionDirection := "None"

// Calculate SMP projection target price
smpTargetPrice := smpEntryPrice + smpCurrentProjection

// Generate new projections
if longSignalActive
    projectionDirection := "long"
    projectionStartBar := bar_index
    currentProjection := pivot_profit_target_price
    recommendedStopLoss := -pivot_stop_loss_price
    entryPrice := close
    
else if shortSignalActive
    projectionDirection := "short"
    projectionStartBar := bar_index
    currentProjection := -pivot_profit_target_price
    recommendedStopLoss := pivot_stop_loss_price
    entryPrice := close

// Calculate projection target price
targetPrice := entryPrice + currentProjection

// ================================== PROJECTION SYSTEM FUNCTIONS ======================================================
// Function to check if price has reached projection target
check_projection_target() =>
    if projectionDirection == "None" or currentProjection == 0
        false
    else
        if projectionDirection == "long"
            close >= targetPrice
        else if projectionDirection == "short"
            close <= targetPrice
        else
            false

// Function to check if stop loss has been hit
check_stop_loss_hit() =>
    if projectionDirection == "None" or recommendedStopLoss == 0
        false
    else
        stop_loss_price = entryPrice + recommendedStopLoss
        
        if projectionDirection == "long"
            close <= stop_loss_price
        else if projectionDirection == "short"
            close >= stop_loss_price
        else
            false

// Function to check if SMP price has reached projection target
check_smp_projection_target() =>
    if smpProjectionDirection == "None" or smpCurrentProjection == 0
        false
    else
        if smpProjectionDirection == "long"
            close >= smpTargetPrice
        else if smpProjectionDirection == "short"
            close <= smpTargetPrice
        else
            false

// Function to check if SMP stop loss has been hit
check_smp_stop_loss_hit() =>
    if smpProjectionDirection == "None" or smpRecommendedStopLoss == 0
        false
    else
        stop_loss_price = smpEntryPrice + smpRecommendedStopLoss
        
        if smpProjectionDirection == "long"
            close <= stop_loss_price
        else if smpProjectionDirection == "short"
            close >= stop_loss_price
        else
            false

// Function to check if bounce price has reached projection target
check_bounce_projection_target() =>
    if bounceProjectionDirection == "None" or bounceCurrentProjection == 0
        false
    else
        if bounceProjectionDirection == "long"
            close >= bounceTargetPrice
        else if bounceProjectionDirection == "short"
            close <= bounceTargetPrice
        else
            false

// Function to check if bounce stop loss has been hit
check_bounce_stop_loss_hit() =>
    if bounceProjectionDirection == "None" or bounceRecommendedStopLoss == 0
        false
    else
        stop_loss_price = bounceEntryPrice + bounceRecommendedStopLoss
        
        if bounceProjectionDirection == "long"
            close <= stop_loss_price
        else if bounceProjectionDirection == "short"
            close >= stop_loss_price
        else
            false

// Check projection targets and stop losses
projectionTargetReached = check_projection_target()
stopLossHit = check_stop_loss_hit()
smpProjectionTargetReached = check_smp_projection_target()
smpStopLossHit = check_smp_stop_loss_hit()
bounceProjectionTargetReached = check_bounce_projection_target()
bounceStopLossHit = check_bounce_stop_loss_hit()

// Mark projections as completed if target or stop loss is hit
if (projectionTargetReached or stopLossHit) and not projectionCompleted
    projectionCompleted := true

if (smpProjectionTargetReached or smpStopLossHit) and not smpProjectionCompleted
    smpProjectionCompleted := true

if (bounceProjectionTargetReached or bounceStopLossHit) and not bounceProjectionCompleted
    bounceProjectionCompleted := true

// ================================== SUCCESS TRACKING (OPTIMIZED) =====================================================
// Track success rate of Syzygy Momentum Peak signals ----------------------------------------------------------------
var array<int> longMomentumPeakBars = array.new<int>()
var array<int> shortMomentumPeakBars = array.new<int>()
var array<bool> longMomentumPeakResults = array.new<bool>()
var array<bool> shortMomentumPeakResults = array.new<bool>()

// Track new momentum peak signals with optimized array management
if strict_momentum_peak_long or potential_momentum_peak_long
    array.unshift(longMomentumPeakBars, bar_index)
    if array.size(longMomentumPeakBars) > MAX_SIGNALS
        array.pop(longMomentumPeakBars)
    if array.size(longMomentumPeakResults) > 0
        array.pop(longMomentumPeakResults)

if strict_momentum_peak_short or potential_momentum_peak_short
    array.unshift(shortMomentumPeakBars, bar_index)
    if array.size(shortMomentumPeakBars) > MAX_SIGNALS
        array.pop(shortMomentumPeakBars)
    if array.size(shortMomentumPeakResults) > 0
        array.pop(shortMomentumPeakResults)

// Track success rate of Syzygy Pivot signals ------------------------------------------------------------------------
var array<int> longPivotBars = array.new<int>()
var array<int> shortPivotBars = array.new<int>()
var array<bool> longPivotResults = array.new<bool>()
var array<bool> shortPivotResults = array.new<bool>()

// Track new pivot signals with optimized array management
if longSignalActive
    array.unshift(longPivotBars, bar_index)
    if array.size(longPivotBars) > MAX_SIGNALS
        array.pop(longPivotBars)
    if array.size(longPivotResults) > 0
        array.pop(longPivotResults)

if shortSignalActive
    array.unshift(shortPivotBars, bar_index)
    if array.size(shortPivotBars) > MAX_SIGNALS
        array.pop(shortPivotBars)
    if array.size(shortPivotResults) > 0
        array.pop(shortPivotResults)

// Only evaluate results every 5 bars for performance
if bar_index % 5 == 0 and bar_index >= success_lookback_bars
    // Evaluate momentum peak results
    if array.size(longMomentumPeakBars) > 0 and array.size(longMomentumPeakBars) > array.size(longMomentumPeakResults)
        oldest_peak_bar = array.get(longMomentumPeakBars, array.size(longMomentumPeakResults))
        bars_since_peak = bar_index - oldest_peak_bar
        
        if bars_since_peak >= success_lookback_bars
            peak_price = close[success_lookback_bars]
            current_price = close
            price_change_pct = ((current_price - peak_price) / peak_price) * 100
            
            pip_value = close * 0.0001
            profit_target_pct = (smp_profit_target_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            stop_loss_pct = (smp_stop_loss_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            
            is_success = price_change_pct >= profit_target_pct
            is_reversal = price_change_pct <= -stop_loss_pct
            
            result = is_success ? true : (is_reversal ? false : na)
            if not na(result)
                array.push(longMomentumPeakResults, result)

    if array.size(shortMomentumPeakBars) > 0 and array.size(shortMomentumPeakBars) > array.size(shortMomentumPeakResults)
        oldest_peak_bar = array.get(shortMomentumPeakBars, array.size(shortMomentumPeakResults))
        bars_since_peak = bar_index - oldest_peak_bar
        
        if bars_since_peak >= success_lookback_bars
            peak_price = close[success_lookback_bars]
            current_price = close
            price_change_pct = ((peak_price - current_price) / peak_price) * 100
            
            pip_value = close * 0.0001
            profit_target_pct = (smp_profit_target_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            stop_loss_pct = (smp_stop_loss_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            
            is_success = price_change_pct >= profit_target_pct
            is_reversal = price_change_pct <= -stop_loss_pct
            
            result = is_success ? true : (is_reversal ? false : na)
            if not na(result)
                array.push(shortMomentumPeakResults, result)

    // Evaluate pivot results
    if array.size(longPivotBars) > 0 and array.size(longPivotBars) > array.size(longPivotResults)
        oldest_pivot_bar = array.get(longPivotBars, array.size(longPivotResults))
        bars_since_pivot = bar_index - oldest_pivot_bar
        
        if bars_since_pivot >= success_lookback_bars
            pivot_price = close[success_lookback_bars]
            current_price = close
            price_change_pct = ((current_price - pivot_price) / pivot_price) * 100
            
            pip_value = close * 0.0001
            profit_target_pct = (pivot_profit_target_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            stop_loss_pct = (pivot_stop_loss_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            
            is_success = price_change_pct >= profit_target_pct
            is_reversal = price_change_pct <= -stop_loss_pct
            
            result = is_success ? true : (is_reversal ? false : na)
            if not na(result)
                array.push(longPivotResults, result)

    if array.size(shortPivotBars) > 0 and array.size(shortPivotBars) > array.size(shortPivotResults)
        oldest_pivot_bar = array.get(shortPivotBars, array.size(shortPivotResults))
        bars_since_pivot = bar_index - oldest_pivot_bar
        
        if bars_since_pivot >= success_lookback_bars
            pivot_price = close[success_lookback_bars]
            current_price = close
            price_change_pct = ((pivot_price - current_price) / pivot_price) * 100
            
            pip_value = close * 0.0001
            profit_target_pct = (pivot_profit_target_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            stop_loss_pct = (pivot_stop_loss_pips * pip_value / close) * 100
            
            is_success = price_change_pct >= profit_target_pct
            is_reversal = price_change_pct <= -stop_loss_pct
            
            result = is_success ? true : (is_reversal ? false : na)
            if not na(result)
                array.push(shortPivotResults, result)

// Calculate success ratios - only when needed for display
long_total_count = array.size(longMomentumPeakResults)
short_total_count = array.size(shortMomentumPeakResults)
pivot_long_total_count = array.size(longPivotResults)
pivot_short_total_count = array.size(shortPivotResults)

// Overall success ratio - optimized calculation
total_signals := long_total_count + short_total_count
total_successes = 0
if long_total_count > 0
    for i = 0 to math.min(long_total_count - 1, 19)
        if array.get(longMomentumPeakResults, i)
            total_successes := total_successes + 1
if short_total_count > 0
    for i = 0 to math.min(short_total_count - 1, 19)
        if array.get(shortMomentumPeakResults, i)
            total_successes := total_successes + 1
overall_success_ratio := total_signals > 0 ? (total_successes / total_signals) * 100 : 0.0

// Pivot success ratio - optimized calculation
pivot_total_signals := pivot_long_total_count + pivot_short_total_count
pivot_total_successes = 0
if pivot_long_total_count > 0
    for i = 0 to math.min(pivot_long_total_count - 1, 19)
        if array.get(longPivotResults, i)
            pivot_total_successes := pivot_total_successes + 1
if pivot_short_total_count > 0
    for i = 0 to math.min(pivot_short_total_count - 1, 19)
        if array.get(shortPivotResults, i)
            pivot_total_successes := pivot_total_successes + 1
pivot_success_ratio := pivot_total_signals > 0 ? (pivot_total_successes / pivot_total_signals) * 100 : 0.0

// ================================== ALERT STATUS TRACKING ============================================================
// Create persistent variables to track the last triggered alert and its bar index -------------------------------------
var string lastAlertType = "None"
var int lastAlertBarIndex = 0

// SMP alert tracking variables
var string lastSMPAlertType = "None"
var int lastSMPAlertBarIndex = 0

// Update alert status based on conditions - track all signal types ---------------------------------------------------
if longSignalActive
    lastAlertType := "SYZ_PIVOT_LONG"
    lastAlertBarIndex := bar_index
else if shortSignalActive
    lastAlertType := "SYZ_PIVOT_SHORT"
    lastAlertBarIndex := bar_index

// Update SMP alert status based on conditions
if strict_momentum_peak_long
    lastSMPAlertType := "SMP_STRONG"
    lastSMPAlertBarIndex := bar_index
else if strict_momentum_peak_short
    lastSMPAlertType := "SMP_STRONG"
    lastSMPAlertBarIndex := bar_index
else if potential_momentum_peak_long
    lastSMPAlertType := "SMP_WEAK"
    lastSMPAlertBarIndex := bar_index
else if potential_momentum_peak_short
    lastSMPAlertType := "SMP_WEAK"
    lastSMPAlertBarIndex := bar_index

// Calculate bars since last alert -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
barsSinceLastAlert = bar_index == lastAlertBarIndex ? 1 : bar_index - lastAlertBarIndex
barsSinceLastSMPAlert = bar_index == lastSMPAlertBarIndex ? 1 : bar_index - lastSMPAlertBarIndex

// ======================================= VISUALIZATION ===============================================================
// Determine price line color based on technical conditions ------------------------------------------------------------
priceLineColor = determine_price_line_color(close, ema1, ema2, middleEMA)

// Plot price and middle EMA with the dynamic color --------------------------------------------------------------------
pricePlot = plot(close, color=color.new(priceLineColor, 0), linewidth=2, title="Price Line", 
     style=plot.style_line, editable=true, show_last=5000)
middleEMAPlot = plot(middleEMA, color=color.new(priceLineColor, 0), linewidth=2, 
     title="Middle EMA Line", style=plot.style_line, editable=true, show_last=5000)

// Fill area between price and middle EMA for visual emphasis ----------------------------------------------------------
fill(pricePlot, middleEMAPlot, color.new(priceLineColor, 50))

// Plot EMAs conditionally based on user preferences -------------------------------------------------------------------
plot(showSuperFastEMA ? ema3 : na, color=color.rgb(0, 255, 255), title="Super Fast EMA", linewidth=2)
plot(showFastEMA ? ema1 : na, color=color.yellow, title="Fast EMA", linewidth=2)
plot(showMiddleEMA ? middleEMA : na, color=color.silver, title="Middle EMA", linewidth=2)
plot(showSlowEMA ? ema2 : na, color=color.purple, title="Slow EMA", linewidth=4)

// Plot trading signals ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
plotshape(series=longSignalActive, location=location.bottom, color=color.lime, 
     style=shape.triangleup, size=size.small, title="Syzygy Cross Long", text="B", textcolor=color.lime)
plotshape(series=shortSignalActive, location=location.top, color=color.white, 
     style=shape.triangledown, size=size.small, title="Syzygy Cross Short", text="S", textcolor=color.white)

// Plot overbought/oversold markers ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
plotshape(rsiOverboughtAlert, location=location.abovebar, color=color.red,
     style=shape.circle, size=size.tiny, title="Overbought")
plotshape(rsiOversoldAlert, location=location.belowbar, color=color.lime, 
     style=shape.circle, size=size.tiny, title="Oversold")

// Draw vertical line at signal points ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
if longSignalActive
    line.new(bar_index, 0, bar_index, 0, extend=extend.both, 
         color=#43b593, width=1, style=line.style_dotted)

if shortSignalActive
    line.new(bar_index, 0, bar_index, 0, extend=extend.both, 
         color=color.gray, width=1, style=line.style_dotted)

// Plot SMP dots with text labels indicating strength
plotshape(strict_momentum_peak_long, location=location.belowbar, color=#dec20b, style=shape.circle, size=size.small, title="Strong Long Momentum Peak")
plotshape(potential_momentum_peak_long, location=location.belowbar, color=#7371df, style=shape.circle, size=size.tiny, title="Weak Long Momentum Peak")
plotshape(strict_momentum_peak_short, location=location.abovebar, color=#dec20b, style=shape.circle, size=size.small, title="Strong Short Momentum Peak")
plotshape(potential_momentum_peak_short, location=location.abovebar, color=#7371df, style=shape.circle, size=size.tiny, title="Weak Short Momentum Peak")

// ================================== PROJECTION VISUALS ==============================================================
// Clear previous projection visuals when a new projection is generated
if (longSignalActive or shortSignalActive) and projectionDirection != "None"
    line.delete(currentProjectionLine)
    label.delete(currentProjectionLabel)
    line.delete(currentStopLossLine)
    label.delete(currentStopLossLabel)
    projectionCompleted := false
    targetEverReached := false
    stopLossEverHit := false

// Draw pivot projection lines and labels (only once per signal)
if show_pivot_projection_lines and projectionDirection == "long" and targetPrice > 0 and not projectionCompleted and (longSignalActive or shortSignalActive)
    currentProjectionLine := line.new(bar_index, targetPrice, bar_index + 25, targetPrice, extend=extend.none, 
         color=color.green, width=1, style=line.style_dashed)
    currentProjectionLabel := label.new(bar_index + 10, targetPrice, text="PVT PT: " + str.tostring(targetPrice, "#.####"), 
         color=color.new(color.green, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)
    
    if recommendedStopLoss != 0
        stop_loss_price = entryPrice + recommendedStopLoss
        currentStopLossLine := line.new(projectionStartBar, stop_loss_price, bar_index + 25, stop_loss_price, extend=extend.none, 
             color=color.red, width=1, style=line.style_solid)
        currentStopLossLabel := label.new(projectionStartBar + 10, stop_loss_price, text="PVT SL: " + str.tostring(stop_loss_price, "#.####"), 
             color=color.new(color.red, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)

if show_pivot_projection_lines and projectionDirection == "short" and targetPrice > 0 and not projectionCompleted and (longSignalActive or shortSignalActive)
    currentProjectionLine := line.new(bar_index, targetPrice, bar_index + 25, targetPrice, extend=extend.none, 
         color=color.red, width=1, style=line.style_dashed)
    currentProjectionLabel := label.new(bar_index + 10, targetPrice, text="PVT PT: " + str.tostring(targetPrice, "#.####"), 
         color=color.new(color.red, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)
    
    if recommendedStopLoss != 0
        stop_loss_price = entryPrice + recommendedStopLoss
        currentStopLossLine := line.new(projectionStartBar, stop_loss_price, bar_index + 25, stop_loss_price, extend=extend.none, 
             color=color.green, width=1, style=line.style_solid)
        currentStopLossLabel := label.new(projectionStartBar + 10, stop_loss_price, text="PVT SL: " + str.tostring(stop_loss_price, "#.####"), 
             color=color.new(color.green, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)

// Clear previous SMP projection visuals when a new SMP projection is generated
if (strict_momentum_peak_long or strict_momentum_peak_short or potential_momentum_peak_long or potential_momentum_peak_short) and smpProjectionDirection != "None"
    line.delete(smpCurrentProjectionLine)
    label.delete(smpCurrentProjectionLabel)
    line.delete(smpCurrentStopLossLine)
    label.delete(smpCurrentStopLossLabel)
    smpProjectionCompleted := false
    smpTargetEverReached := false
    smpStopLossEverHit := false

// Draw SMP projection lines and labels (only once per signal)
if show_smp_projection_lines and smpProjectionDirection == "long" and smpTargetPrice > 0 and not smpProjectionCompleted and (strict_momentum_peak_long or potential_momentum_peak_long)
    smpCurrentProjectionLine := line.new(bar_index, smpTargetPrice, bar_index + 25, smpTargetPrice, extend=extend.none, 
         color=color.blue, width=1, style=line.style_dashed)
    smpCurrentProjectionLabel := label.new(bar_index + 10, smpTargetPrice, text="SMP PT: " + str.tostring(smpTargetPrice, "#.####"), 
         color=color.new(color.blue, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)
    
    if smpRecommendedStopLoss != 0
        stop_loss_price = smpEntryPrice + smpRecommendedStopLoss
        smpCurrentStopLossLine := line.new(smpProjectionStartBar, stop_loss_price, bar_index + 25, stop_loss_price, extend=extend.none, 
             color=color.orange, width=1, style=line.style_solid)
        smpCurrentStopLossLabel := label.new(smpProjectionStartBar + 10, stop_loss_price, text="SMP SL: " + str.tostring(stop_loss_price, "#.####"), 
             color=color.new(color.orange, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)

if show_smp_projection_lines and smpProjectionDirection == "short" and smpTargetPrice > 0 and not smpProjectionCompleted and (strict_momentum_peak_short or potential_momentum_peak_short)
    smpCurrentProjectionLine := line.new(bar_index, smpTargetPrice, bar_index + 25, smpTargetPrice, extend=extend.none, 
         color=color.purple, width=1, style=line.style_dashed)
    smpCurrentProjectionLabel := label.new(bar_index + 10, smpTargetPrice, text="SMP PT: " + str.tostring(smpTargetPrice, "#.####"), 
         color=color.new(color.purple, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)
    
    if smpRecommendedStopLoss != 0
        stop_loss_price = smpEntryPrice + smpRecommendedStopLoss
        smpCurrentStopLossLine := line.new(smpProjectionStartBar, stop_loss_price, bar_index + 25, stop_loss_price, extend=extend.none, 
             color=color.orange, width=1, style=line.style_solid)
        smpCurrentStopLossLabel := label.new(smpProjectionStartBar + 10, stop_loss_price, text="SMP SL: " + str.tostring(stop_loss_price, "#.####"), 
             color=color.new(color.orange, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)

// Plot first indicator that triggers (target or stop loss)
showTargetReached = projectionTargetReached and not targetEverReached and not stopLossEverHit
showStopLossHit = stopLossHit and not stopLossEverHit and not targetEverReached

// Set flags when indicators trigger
if projectionTargetReached
    targetEverReached := true
if stopLossHit
    stopLossEverHit := true

plotshape(showTargetReached, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.yellow, 100), style=shape.circle, size=size.tiny, 
     title="Projection Target Reached", text="🎯", textcolor=color.black)

plotshape(showStopLossHit, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(color.red, 100), style=shape.circle, size=size.small, 
     title="Stop Loss Hit", text="💀", textcolor=color.white)

// ================================== BOUNCE PROJECTION VISUALS ======================================================
// Clear previous bounce projection visuals when a new bounce projection is generated
if (long_bounce_detected and not long_pullback_alerted[1] or short_bounce_detected and not short_pullback_alerted[1]) and bounceProjectionDirection != "None"
    line.delete(bounceCurrentProjectionLine)
    label.delete(bounceCurrentProjectionLabel)
    line.delete(bounceCurrentStopLossLine)
    label.delete(bounceCurrentStopLossLabel)
    bounceProjectionCompleted := false
    bounceTargetEverReached := false
    bounceStopLossEverHit := false

// Draw bounce projection lines and labels (only once per signal)
if show_bounce_projection_lines and bounceProjectionDirection == "long" and bounceTargetPrice > 0 and not bounceProjectionCompleted and (long_bounce_detected and not long_pullback_alerted[1])
    bounceCurrentProjectionLine := line.new(bar_index, bounceTargetPrice, bar_index + 25, bounceTargetPrice, extend=extend.none, 
         color=color.lime, width=1, style=line.style_dashed)
    bounceCurrentProjectionLabel := label.new(bar_index + 10, bounceTargetPrice, text="BOUNCE PT: " + str.tostring(bounceTargetPrice, "#.####"), 
         color=color.new(color.lime, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)
    
    if bounceRecommendedStopLoss != 0
        stop_loss_price = bounceEntryPrice + bounceRecommendedStopLoss
        bounceCurrentStopLossLine := line.new(bounceProjectionStartBar, stop_loss_price, bar_index + 25, stop_loss_price, extend=extend.none, 
             color=color.red, width=1, style=line.style_solid)
        bounceCurrentStopLossLabel := label.new(bounceProjectionStartBar + 10, stop_loss_price, text="BOUNCE SL: " + str.tostring(stop_loss_price, "#.####"), 
             color=color.new(color.red, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)

if show_bounce_projection_lines and bounceProjectionDirection == "short" and bounceTargetPrice > 0 and not bounceProjectionCompleted and (short_bounce_detected and not short_pullback_alerted[1])
    bounceCurrentProjectionLine := line.new(bar_index, bounceTargetPrice, bar_index + 25, bounceTargetPrice, extend=extend.none, 
         color=color.red, width=1, style=line.style_dashed)
    bounceCurrentProjectionLabel := label.new(bar_index + 10, bounceTargetPrice, text="BOUNCE PT: " + str.tostring(bounceTargetPrice, "#.####"), 
         color=color.new(color.red, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)
    
    if bounceRecommendedStopLoss != 0
        stop_loss_price = bounceEntryPrice + bounceRecommendedStopLoss
        bounceCurrentStopLossLine := line.new(bounceProjectionStartBar, stop_loss_price, bar_index + 25, stop_loss_price, extend=extend.none, 
             color=color.lime, width=1, style=line.style_solid)
        bounceCurrentStopLossLabel := label.new(bounceProjectionStartBar + 10, stop_loss_price, text="BOUNCE SL: " + str.tostring(stop_loss_price, "#.####"), 
             color=color.new(color.lime, 100), textcolor=color.white, style=label.style_label_left, size=size.normal)

// Plot bounce profit target and stop loss indicators (only once per signal)
showBounceTargetReached = bounceProjectionTargetReached and not bounceTargetEverReached and not bounceStopLossEverHit
showBounceStopLossHit = bounceStopLossHit and not bounceStopLossEverHit and not bounceTargetEverReached

// Set flags when indicators trigger
if bounceProjectionTargetReached
    bounceTargetEverReached := true
if bounceStopLossHit
    bounceStopLossEverHit := true

plotshape(showBounceTargetReached, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.lime, 100), style=shape.circle, size=size.tiny, 
     title="Bounce Profit Target Reached", text="🎯", textcolor=color.black)

plotshape(showBounceStopLossHit, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(color.red, 100), style=shape.circle, size=size.small, 
     title="Bounce Stop Loss Hit", text="💀", textcolor=color.white)

// ================================== PULLBACK DETECTION VISUALS ======================================================
// Visual indicators for pullback detection after pivot signals --------------------------------------------------------

// Set alert flags to prevent multiple plots
if long_pullback_detected and not long_pullback_alerted
    long_pullback_alerted := true

if short_pullback_detected and not short_pullback_alerted
    short_pullback_alerted := true

// Plot pullback bounce indicators (only on the exact bounce bar)
plotshape(show_pullback_indicators and enable_pullback_detection and long_pullback_detected and long_pullback_low > 0 and close > long_pullback_low and close[1] <= long_pullback_low and ema3 > middleEMA, 
     location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(color.green, 100), style=shape.circle, size=size.small, 
     title="Long Pivot Pullback Bounce", text="🟢", textcolor=color.white)

plotshape(show_pullback_indicators and enable_pullback_detection and short_pullback_detected and short_pullback_high > 0 and close < short_pullback_high and close[1] >= short_pullback_high and ema3 < middleEMA, 
     location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.red, 100), style=shape.circle, size=size.small, 
     title="Short Pivot Pullback Bounce", text="🔴", textcolor=color.white)

// ================================== RSI & ADX MONITOR TABLE (OPTIMIZED) ==============================================

// Only update table when signals change or every 10 bars for performance
var string lastTableUpdateKey = ""
tableUpdateKey = str.tostring(longSignalActive) + str.tostring(shortSignalActive) + str.tostring(strict_momentum_peak_long) + str.tostring(strict_momentum_peak_short) + str.tostring(bar_index % 10)

if show_table and (tableUpdateKey != lastTableUpdateKey)
    lastTableUpdateKey := tableUpdateKey
    
    // Create table with position based on user selection
    var table monitor_table = table.new(position = table_position == "top_right" ? 
     position.top_right : table_position == "top_left" ? position.top_left : table_position == "bottom_left" ? 
     position.bottom_left : position.bottom_right, columns = 2, rows = 6, bgcolor = color.rgb(0, 0, 0, 80), 
     border_width = 1)

    // Combined Alert Status and Style row - cached calculations
    alert_activation_status = enable_alerts ? "Active ✅" : "Inactive ❌"
    style_color = trading_style == "Scalping" ? color.green: trading_style == "Day Trading" ? color.orange : trading_style == "Swing Trading" ? color.blue : color.gray
    combined_alert_style = alert_activation_status + " | " + trading_style
    alert_color = enable_alerts ? color.teal : color.maroon
    blended_alert_style_color = color.rgb(
     math.round((color.r(alert_color) + color.r(style_color)) / 2),
     math.round((color.g(alert_color) + color.g(style_color)) / 2),
     math.round((color.b(alert_color) + color.b(style_color)) / 2)
     )
    alert_style_text_color = get_color_brightness(color.r(blended_alert_style_color), color.g(blended_alert_style_color), color.b(blended_alert_style_color)) > 128 ? color.black : color.white
    table.cell(monitor_table, 0, 0, "Alerts & Style", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.normal, bgcolor=color.black)
    table.cell(monitor_table, 1, 0, combined_alert_style, bgcolor=color.rgb(108, 107, 111), text_color=alert_style_text_color, text_size=size.normal)

    // Combined Indicators row - cached calculations
    trend_direction = plus_di > minus_di ? "Bullish" : "Bearish"
    trend_emoji = plus_di > minus_di ? "🟢" : "🔴"
    rsi_display = str.tostring(math.round(rsi_value, 2))
    if rsi_value <= rsi_oversold
        rsi_display := rsi_display + " 🟢"
    else if rsi_value >= rsi_overbought
        rsi_display := rsi_display + " 🔴"
    else
        rsi_display := rsi_display + " 🇨🇭"
    adx_signal = adx_value >= adx_threshold ? "Strong" : "Weak"
    adx_emoji = adx_value >= adx_threshold ? "💪" : "🥺"
    volume_ratio = volume / volume_ma
    volume_status = if volume_ratio <= 0.5
        "Low 📉"
    else if volume_ratio <= 1.0
        "Normal 📊"
    else if volume_ratio <= volume_threshold_multiplier
        "Above Avg 📈"
    else
        "High 🚀"
    combined_indicators = trend_direction + " " + trend_emoji + " | ADX: " + adx_signal + " " + adx_emoji + " | RSI: " + rsi_display + " | Vol: " + volume_status
    rsi_gradient_color = get_rsi_gradient_color(rsi_value, rsi_oversold, rsi_overbought)
    indicators_text_color = get_color_brightness(color.r(rsi_gradient_color), color.g(rsi_gradient_color), color.b(rsi_gradient_color)) > 128 ? color.black : color.white
    table.cell(monitor_table, 0, 1, "Indicators", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.normal, bgcolor=color.black)
    table.cell(monitor_table, 1, 1, combined_indicators, bgcolor=rsi_gradient_color, text_color=indicators_text_color, text_size=size.normal)

    // SMP Alerts row - cached setup calculation
    [setup_message, setup_color] = get_optimal_setup()
    
    // Create SMP alert status with previous alert info
    smp_alert_status = lastSMPAlertType == "None" ? "No SMP Alerts" : barsSinceLastSMPAlert == 0 ? lastSMPAlertType + " 🟡 LIVE" : lastSMPAlertType
    
    // Add success rate to SMP info (only if enabled)
    smp_success_info = ""
    if show_smp_success_rate
        smp_success_rate = total_signals > 0 ? str.tostring(math.round(overall_success_ratio, 1)) + "%" : "N/A"
        smp_success_info := " | Success: " + smp_success_rate + " (" + str.tostring(total_signals) + " signals)"
    
    // Combine current setup with alert status and success rate
    smp_combined_info = setup_message + " | Last: " + smp_alert_status + smp_success_info
    
    // Determine text color based on background color for better readability
    smp_text_color = setup_color == color.lime or setup_color == color.green ? color.black : color.white
    
    table.cell(monitor_table, 0, 2, "SMP Alerts", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.normal, bgcolor=color.black)
    table.cell(monitor_table, 1, 2, smp_combined_info, text_color=smp_text_color, bgcolor=setup_color, text_size=size.normal)

    // Pivot Alerts row - cached calculations
    simplified_alert_status = lastAlertType == "None" ? "No Alerts" : barsSinceLastAlert == 0 ? lastAlertType + " 🟡 LIVE" : lastAlertType
    
    // Add success rate to pivot info (only if enabled)
    pivot_success_info = ""
    if show_pivot_success_rate
        pivot_success_rate = pivot_total_signals > 0 ? str.tostring(math.round(pivot_success_ratio, 1)) + "%" : "N/A"
        pivot_success_info := " | Success: " + pivot_success_rate + " (" + str.tostring(pivot_total_signals) + " signals)"
    
    // Set trend color based on alert type
    trend_color = lastAlertType == "SYZ_PIVOT_LONG" ? color.teal : lastAlertType == "SYZ_PIVOT_SHORT" ? color.maroon : color.gray
    
    combined_pivot_trends = simplified_alert_status + " | Duration: " + str.tostring(barsSinceLastAlert) + " bars ago" + pivot_success_info
    
    table.cell(monitor_table, 0, 3, "Pivot Alerts", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.normal, bgcolor=color.black)
    table.cell(monitor_table, 1, 3, combined_pivot_trends, text_color=color.white, bgcolor=trend_color, text_size=size.normal)

    // Pullback Detection row - only show if enabled
    if enable_pullback_detection
        // Calculate pullback bounce status information
        long_pullback_status = long_bounce_detected ? "LONG BOUNCE 📉" : long_pullback_detected ? "LONG PULLBACK" : "No Long Pullback"
        short_pullback_status = short_bounce_detected ? "SHORT BOUNCE 📈" : short_pullback_detected ? "SHORT PULLBACK" : "No Short Pullback"
        
        // Calculate bars since pullback detection
        bars_since_long_pullback = long_pullback_detected ? bar_index - last_long_pullback_bar : 0
        bars_since_short_pullback = short_pullback_detected ? bar_index - last_short_pullback_bar : 0
        
        // Create pullback display text
        pullback_display = ""
        if long_bounce_detected
            pullback_display := long_pullback_status + " (" + str.tostring(bars_since_long_pullback) + " bars ago)"
        else if short_bounce_detected
            pullback_display := short_pullback_status + " (" + str.tostring(bars_since_short_pullback) + " bars ago)"
        else if long_pullback_detected
            pullback_display := long_pullback_status + " (" + str.tostring(bars_since_long_pullback) + " bars ago)"
        else if short_pullback_detected
            pullback_display := short_pullback_status + " (" + str.tostring(bars_since_short_pullback) + " bars ago)"
        else
            pullback_display := "No Pullbacks Detected"
        
        // Add success rate to pullback info (only if enabled)
        pullback_success_info = ""
        if show_pullback_success_rate
            pullback_success_rate = pullback_total_signals > 0 ? str.tostring(math.round(pullback_success_ratio, 1)) + "%" : "N/A"
            pullback_success_info := " | Success: " + pullback_success_rate + " (" + str.tostring(pullback_total_signals) + " signals)"
        
        // Combine pullback status with success rate
        pullback_combined_info = pullback_display + pullback_success_info
        
        // Set pullback color based on detection status
        pullback_color = long_bounce_detected ? color.aqua : short_bounce_detected ? color.fuchsia : long_pullback_detected ? color.new(color.aqua, 50) : short_pullback_detected ? color.new(color.fuchsia, 50) : color.gray
        
        table.cell(monitor_table, 0, 4, "Pullback Detection", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.normal, bgcolor=color.black)
        table.cell(monitor_table, 1, 4, pullback_combined_info, text_color=color.white, bgcolor=pullback_color, text_size=size.normal)

    // Market Structure row - cached calculations (only show if enabled)
    if show_market_structure
        market_structure_text = market_structure == "TRENDING" ? "TRENDING" : market_structure == "RANGING" ? "RANGING" : "MIXED"
        structure_confidence_text = str.tostring(math.round(structure_confidence, 0)) + "%"
        structure_change_info = bars_since_structure_change > 0 ? " | " + str.tostring(bars_since_structure_change) + " bars ago" : " | LIVE"
        market_structure_display = market_structure_text + " | Confidence: " + structure_confidence_text + structure_change_info
        
        // Use dark text for yellow background (mixed market) for better readability
        structure_text_color = structure_color == color.yellow ? color.black : color.white
        
        table.cell(monitor_table, 0, 5, "Market Structure", text_color=color.white, text_size=size.normal, bgcolor=color.black)
        table.cell(monitor_table, 1, 5, market_structure_display, text_color=structure_text_color, text_size=size.normal, bgcolor=structure_color)

// ========================================== ALERTS ===================================================================

// Long and short trading alerts ----------------------------------------------------------------------
alertcondition(longSignalActive and enable_alerts, title="Syzygy Pivot Long", message="SYZ_PIVOT_LONG Alert \nTicker: {{ticker}}\nPrice: {{close}}\nChart: https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol={{ticker}}")
alertcondition(shortSignalActive and enable_alerts, title="Syzygy Pivot Short", message="SYZ_PIVOT_SHORT Alert \nTicker: {{ticker}}\nPrice: {{close}}\nChart: https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol={{ticker}}")

// ================================= SYZYGY MOMENTUM PEAK ALERTS =======================================================
// Alert condition for Syzygy Momentum Peak with enhanced descriptive message -----------------------------------------
alertcondition(syzygy_momentum_peak_signal and enable_alerts and enable_smp_alerts, title="Syzygy Momentum Peak", message="SYZYGY_MOMENTUM_PEAK\nTicker: {{ticker}}\nPrice: {{close}}\nSignal: Momentum Peak (Long/Short, Strong/Weak)\nVolume: {{volume}}\nTime: {{time}}\nChart: https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol={{ticker}}")

// ================================== PULLBACK DETECTION ALERTS ========================================================
// Alert conditions for pullback detection after pivot signals ---------------------------------------------------------
alertcondition(long_pullback_detected and enable_pullback_detection and enable_alerts and enable_pullback_alerts, title="Long Pivot Pullback Detected", 
     message="LONG_PIVOT_PULLBACK\nTicker: {{ticker}}\nPrice: {{close}}\nChart: https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol={{ticker}}")

alertcondition(short_pullback_detected and enable_pullback_detection and enable_alerts and enable_pullback_alerts, title="Short Pivot Pullback Detected", 
     message="SHORT_PIVOT_PULLBACK\nTicker: {{ticker}}\nPrice: {{close}}\nChart: https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol={{ticker}}")

// ================================== BOUNCE DETECTION ALERTS ==========================================================
// Alert conditions for bounce detection after pullback signals --------------------------------------------------------
alertcondition(long_bounce_detected and enable_pullback_detection and enable_alerts and enable_bounce_alerts, title="Long Pivot Bounce Detected", 
     message="LONG_PIVOT_BOUNCE\nTicker: {{ticker}}\nPrice: {{close}}\nChart: https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol={{ticker}}")

alertcondition(short_bounce_detected and enable_pullback_detection and enable_alerts and enable_bounce_alerts, title="Short Pivot Bounce Detected", 
     message="SHORT_PIVOT_BOUNCE\nTicker: {{ticker}}\nPrice: {{close}}\nChart: https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol={{ticker}}")

